----
l1: $ G , x ∊ cl_ctx_wf_cons J ⇒ x ∊ cl_ctx_wf_cons J $ by ax
l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_ctx_wf_cons J ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ctx_wf y z) ∅ , ra_ctx_wf y ⟨ kc_cons , scons v (scons z ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ∧ ra_capp z y u ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq u v v ⟨ kc_srt , scons w ∅ ⟩ ∈ J) $ by cab_elim [l1]
