l9: $ G , c = ra_tys_ok t1 t2 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J $ by ax
