l21: $ G , ⟨ pp , ra_large t1 t2 ⟩ ∈ cl_large_nz ∪ (cl_large_empty ∪ (cl_large_single)) , ⟨ pp , ra_large t1 t2 ⟩ ∈ cl_large_nz ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ D ∃ b_v ∃ P ∃ T ∃ F ∃ C ∃ k_v ∃ l_v (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = D ∧ ra_ind_data D b_v P T ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty T ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ F C ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort F k_v l_v ∈ lrel ∧ lveq ⟨ kc_lmax , scons ⟨ kc_ls , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ (scons l_v ∅) ⟩ l_v) $ by j2_d_large_nz [l19, l20]
