l15: $ G , c = ra_large t1 t2 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ p , ra_large t1 t2 ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J $ by wcel_eq_l [l14, l10]
