l18: $ G , c = ra_large t1 t2 ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ D ∃ b_v ∃ P ∃ T ∃ F ∃ C ∃ k_v ∃ l_v (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = D ∧ ra_ind_data D b_v P T ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty T ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ F C ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort F k_v l_v ∈ lrel ∧ lveq ⟨ kc_lmax , scons ⟨ kc_ls , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ (scons l_v ∅) ⟩ l_v) ∨ ∃ G_v ∃ D ∃ b_v ∃ P ∃ F (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = D ∧ ra_ind_data D b_v P ⟨ kc_tcons , scons F (scons ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩ ∅)) ⟩ ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ G_v ∃ G2 ∃ D ∃ b_v ∃ P ∃ F ∃ K ∃ np (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = D ∧ ra_ind_data D b_v P ⟨ kc_tcons , scons F (scons ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩ ∅)) ⟩ ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen P np ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp P G_v G2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_fir D np G2 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K ∈ lrel3 J) $ by ex_elim [l8, l17]
