l5: $ G , ⟨ pp , ra_fprops t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⟩ ∈ cl_fprops_z ∪ (cl_fprops_s J) ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_fprops t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⟩ ∈ cl_fprops_z ∪ (cl_fprops_s J) $ by ax
