l10: $ G , ⟨ pp , ra_fprops t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⟩ ∈ cl_fprops_z ∪ (cl_fprops_s J) , ⟨ pp , ra_fprops t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⟩ ∈ cl_fprops_z ⇒ ∃ D ∃ n_v ∃ np ∃ Ctx ∃ d_v ∃ K (t1 = D ∧ t2 = n_v ∧ t3 = np ∧ t4 = Ctx ∧ t5 = d_v ∧ t6 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t7 = K) ∨ ∃ D ∃ n_v ∃ np ∃ Ctx ∃ d_v ∃ cnt ∃ k_v ∃ A ∃ A2 ∃ B (t1 = D ∧ t2 = n_v ∧ t3 = np ∧ t4 = Ctx ∧ t5 = d_v ∧ t6 = ⟨ kc_s , scons cnt ∅ ⟩ ∧ t7 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add d_v np k_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst D ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n_v k_v A A2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq Ctx A2 A2 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_fprops D n_v np ⟨ kc_cons , scons A2 (scons Ctx ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons d_v ∅ ⟩ cnt B ∈ lrel3 J) $ by or_intro_l [l9]
