l11: $ G , c = ra_beq_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J $ by and_elim_r [l9]
l12: $ G , c = ra_beq_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ p = p $ by eq_refl
