  $ G ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_shl_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 ⟩ ∈ pr_shl_eqs J $ > $ G ⇒ crn pp ⊆ lrel3 J $ >
  $ G ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ f_v ∃ fm ∃ fa (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = f_v ∧ t3 = fm ∧ t4 = fa ∧ ra_mul_eqs G_v fm fa ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq G_v f_v f_v j2_c0 ∈ J ∧ ra_deq ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons G_v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons f_v (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j2_c2 ⟩ ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ j2_c1 ∈ J ∧ ra_deq ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons G_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons f_v (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j2_c3 ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons f_v (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons fm (scons ⟨ kc_lit , scons ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j2_c1 ∈ J) $
