l7: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_shr_eqs t1 t2 t3 ⟩ , x ∊ cl_shr_eqs_i J ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ f_v ∃ fd (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = f_v ∧ t3 = fd ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ fd ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq G_v f_v f_v j2_c0 ∈ J ∧ ra_deq ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons G_v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons f_v (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j2_c2 ⟩ ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ j2_c1 ∈ J ∧ ra_deq ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons G_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons f_v (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j2_c3 ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons fd (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons f_v (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_lit , scons ⟨ kc_bd0 , scons ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j2_c1 ∈ J) $ by j2_ex3 [l2, l6]
