lrel3_ite_eqs_cases
-------------------
l1: $ G ⇒ isset (ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7) $ by opair_isset
l2: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⇒ c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 $ by ax
l3: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⇒ ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 = c $ by eq_sym [l2]
l4: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⇒ ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ∈ lrel3 J $ by weaken [#1]
l5: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⇒ c ∈ lrel3 J $ by wcel_eq_l [l3, l4]
l6: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⇒ c ∊ lrel3 J $ by wcel_welc [l5]
l7: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⇒ hprog (lprog3 J) latoms $ by lprog3_hprog
l8: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⇒ ∃ p (⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J) $ by horn_elim [l7, l6]
l9: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J $ by ax
l10: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J $ by and_elim_l [l9]
l11: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J $ by and_elim_r [l9]
l12: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ p = p $ by eq_refl
l13: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 $ by ax
l14: $ G , c = ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ p , c ⟩ = ⟨ p , ra_ite_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 ⟩ $ by opair_eq [l12, l13]
