lemma j2_o_nateq_dec (G: hyps) (J: class) {G_v B t_v u_v Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF eqN deqN beq pq: set} (pp t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 t15: set):
