lemma j2_o_bool_dec (G: hyps) (J: class) {G_v B t_v u_v Not dite ite bp bd: set} (pp t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9: set):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_bool_dec t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 ⟩ ∈ pr_bool_dec J $ > $ G ⇒ crn pp ⊆ lrel3 J $ >
  $ G ⇒ ∃ G_v ∃ B ∃ t_v ∃ u_v ∃ Not ∃ dite ∃ ite ∃ bp ∃ bd (t1 = G_v ∧ t2 = B ∧ t3 = t_v ∧ t4 = u_v ∧ t5 = Not ∧ t6 = dite ∧ t7 = ite ∧ t8 = bp ∧ t9 = bd ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ B ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ u_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Not ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ dite ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ite ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ bp ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ bd ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons G_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons dite (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bp (scons t_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bd (scons t_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_lam , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bp (scons t_v ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_lam , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons Not (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bp (scons t_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ j2_c1 ∈ J ∧ ra_deq ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons G_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons dite (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bp (scons u_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bd (scons u_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_lam , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bp (scons u_v ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_lam , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons Not (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bp (scons u_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ j2_c1 ∈ J ∧ ra_deq ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons ⟨ kc_cons , scons j2_c1 (scons G_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ⟨ kc_app , scons ite (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bp (scons t_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_app , scons bd (scons t_v ∅) ⟩ ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz ,