l4: $ G , c = ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 ⇒ ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 ∈ lrel3 J $ by weaken [#1]
l5: $ G , c = ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 ⇒ c ∈ lrel3 J $ by wcel_eq_l [l3, l4]
l6: $ G , c = ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 ⇒ c ∊ lrel3 J $ by wcel_welc [l5]
l7: $ G , c = ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 ⇒ hprog (lprog3 J) latoms $ by lprog3_hprog
l8: $ G , c = ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 ⇒ ∃ p (⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J) $ by horn_elim [l7, l6]
l9: $ G , c = ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J $ by ax
l10: $ G , c = ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J $ by and_elim_l [l9]
