l13: $ G , c = ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 , ⟨ p , c ⟩ ∈ lprog3 J ∧ crn p ⊆ lrel3 J ⇒ c = ra_fix_eqs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 $ by ax
